    "notes": [
      "SIMPLIFICATION: Salary model is conglobated (stipendio per Art. 112 replaces paga base + scala mobile + EDR + other components). Modeled as base_salary with fixed_allowances: [].",
      "SIMPLIFICATION: First period valid_from set to 2024-09-01 (first tranche date per Allegato A). Pre-tranche salaries from the previous CCNL are out of scope.",
      "SIMPLIFICATION: Seniority cadence is triennale (36 months) for all levels. Art. 113 specifies 4 years for the first scatto at hire — this is not modeled; all scatti computed at 36-month cadence.",
      "SIMPLIFICATION: maximum_count set to 12 (QD maximum per Art. 101). Aree Professionali have maximum 8 scatti per Art. 113; callers should not supply seniority_count > 8 for AP levels.",
      "SIMPLIFICATION: Apprenticeship modeled for destination 3AP-1° (lowest 3AP level, Art. 30). Under-classification: months 0-18 at 2AP-2° (immediately below 3AP-1°), months 18+ at 3AP-1° (destination). Derogation for Art. 3 comma 3 workers (higher destination level) not modeled.",
      "SIMPLIFICATION: Hourly divisor is 160 for both periods (37.5h/week pre-July 2025, 37h/week from July 2025 per Art. 118). Formula: 37.5 x 52 / 12 = 162.5 → 160; 37 x 52 / 12 = 160.33 → 160 (arrotondamento a 5 per difetto per Art. 114).",
      "Workers covered: approximately 36,000 (Federcasse / Banche di Credito Cooperativo, Casse Rurali ed Artigiane). Agreement signed 2024-07-09; valid until 2025-12-31 per Art. 9.",
      "INPS rates from 2026-credito.json (same sector as bancari-abi). IRPEF 2026 brackets applied (L. 199/2025)."
    ]
  },
